@startuml mo_house_pdf
title mo_house_pdf: House bill document PDFs + text
start
:read the mo_house link tables (texts, summaries, fiscal notes,
amendments; bills and Senate acts), keep the kinds selected by
MOGOV_HOUSE_PDF_KINDS and the sessions in MOGOV_HOUSE_PDF_SESSIONS;
note right
  Witness forms and change maps are never linked here.
end note
:one unit per distinct URL, owned by hash(URL) % --shards;
repeat
  if (file already under RAW_DIR/mo_house_pdf/SESSION/KIND/\nand (closed session or younger than 7 days)?) then (yes)
    :read it from disk: no request;
  else (no)
    :GET at the host-wide throttle (1 request/s,
    shared with mo_house and every shard);
    if (PDF bytes (%PDF-)?) then (yes)
      if (bytes differ from the file on disk?) then (yes)
        :write the PDF unchanged;
      else (no)
        :touch the file only;
      endif
    else (HTTP error, timeout, HTML page)
      :error row, no file;
    endif
  endif
  :pdfplumber text per page (mogov.pdftext, stored as-is);
  if (bill text version with text?) then (yes)
    :read the enacting title and Section A for the RSMo sections
    repealed, amended and enacted (mogov.parsers.mo_house_statute_refs);
    :rows in mo_house_pdf_statute_refs (ranges kept as written);
  endif
  :row in mo_house_pdf_files (path, size, sha256, status, error)
  and row in mo_house_pdf_texts (page_count, text, pages_json, error);
repeat while (more URLs?) is (yes)
->no;
stop
@enduml
